        "original_id": "a1795e26-337d-5241-9a50-137fad6645c6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Madden NFL 18, Madden NFL series\n- People: Tom Brady, Rob Gronkowski, Charles Haley\n- Organizations: New England Patriots\n- Events: Super Bowl\n\nFacts:\n- Madden NFL 18 is the 29th installment of the Madden NFL series.\n- Madden NFL 18 features New England Patriots quarterback Tom Brady on its cover.\n- Tom Brady was the second straight New England Patriots player to appear on a Madden NFL cover, following tight end Rob Gronkowski.\n- Tom Brady is one of only two players to win five Super Bowls.\n- Charles Haley is the other player who won five Super Bowls.\n- Tom Brady is the only player to win all five of his Super Bowls while playing for one team.",
